    "When you ask, the question, book title, visible page and up to eight retrieved or selected excerpts are sent to this endpoint. The provider may retain them under its own policy. The whole book is not uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you ask, the question, book title, visible page and up to eight retrieved or selected excerpts are sent to this endpoint. The provider may retain them under its own policy. The whole book is not uploaded."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "При запросе на этот адрес отправятся вопрос, название книги, текущая страница и до восьми найденных или выделенных фрагментов. Провайдер может хранить их по своей политике. Вся книга не загружается."
          }
        }
      }
    },
